# ---docerion
# type: config
# title: .agents .gitignore
# summary: Ignores most content in .agents while keeping OWNERS, the rules README and rust.md, and the skills README checked in so users can add their own rules and skills.
# ---

/*
!.gitignore
!OWNERS

# We want to ignore rules besides any that we check in
# to allow users to make their own.
!rules/
/rules/*
!/rules/README.md
!/rules/rust.md

# We want to ignore skills besides any that we check in (elsewhere)
# to allow users to make their own.
!skills/
/skills/*
!/skills/README.md
